  "comments": {
    "overrides": "Force patched versions of transitive Docusaurus/webpack deps flagged by Dependabot. These are docs-site build/dev dependencies (not shipped in the nl6 binary or image). Pinned to each advisory's first patched version, staying in the installed major where possible. Revisit when Docusaurus updates upstream."
  },
